    <briefdescription>
<para>QSGMaterial for marker (point) rendering. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Passes per-point color, domain bounds, marker size, and shape type to the point fragment shader. Unlike <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineMaterial" kindref="compound">LineMaterial</ref></computeroutput> this class does not inherit from <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1DataTextureMaterial" kindref="compound">DataTextureMaterial</ref></computeroutput> because markers do not require a data texture. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
